# A null source through a `::` cast ([LCST.4.3.4]).
#
#   pump 1  f is null: `(r.f::String?) is null` holds, so `absent` fires and
#           `converted` does not, and the engine goes on.
#   pump 2  f is 2.5: the control, `converted` fires and `absent` does not.
# @spec [RFCS.6.3]
assert Reading entity_id=r1 f=null
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r2 f=2.5
pump
